#. error popup message
#: src/modules/Nfs.rb:320
msgid ""
"Unable to write to /etc/fstab.\n"
"No changes will be made to the\n"
"the NFS client configuration.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນລົງ /etc/fstab.\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບ\n"
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງໂຕລູກຂ່າຍ NFS.\n"

